# Codex-unique special rules

Hit location charts and titan damage-effect tables belong to one army book. Never catalog them under a generic name.

Prefix the `SpecialRule` name with the faction and **Titan**:

```
✅ Tyranid Titan Hit Location Chart          ❌ Hit Location Chart
✅ Imperial Guard Titan Hit Location Chart   ❌ Hit Location Chart
✅ Tyranid Titan Damage Effects              ❌ Damage Effects
```

Keep them as `SpecialRule` rows on that Codex. Shared core rules stay in `Rule` / `SpecialAbility`.
